{"id":"dvitomp.1","n":"dvitomp","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"texlive-metapost","ver":"20200406-26.el9_2","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/t/texlive-metapost-20200406-26.el9_2.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/dvitomp.1.gz","sha256":"d9e0016ceed20174bd3598bc3b9c9613dd40147d7fdc4203ce7e71e7ffcbb0d4","date":"16 June 2015","origin":"Web2C 2020"}},"nopt":{"r":2},"miss":{"r":["--dvitomp"]},"desc":"convert a TeX DVI file to a MetaPost MPXFILE","r":[["NAME","<p>dvitomp - convert a TeX DVI file to a MetaPost MPXFILE</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>dvitomp</b> [<i>OPTIONS</i>] <i>dvifile</i>[<i><b>.dvi</b></i>] [<i>mpxfile</i>[<i><b>.mpx</b></i>]]</p> <p><b>mpost</b> <b>--dvitomp</b> <i>dvifile</i>[<i><b>.dvi</b></i>] [<i>mpxfile</i>[<i><b>.mpx</b></i>]]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>dvitomp</b> translates the given <i>dvifile</i> to a MetaPost MPXFILE. The default <i>mpxfile</i> is the basename of <i>dvifile</i> extended with <b>.mpx</b>.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-help</b></dt><dd>write usage summary and exit.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-version</b></dt><dd>output version information and exit.</dd></dl>"],["BUGS","<p>Email bug reports to metapost@tug.org.</p>"]]}